## 11. Key Design Decisions & Rationale

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| **Virtual sensors first** | Allows full development without hardware dependency. Hardware is a drop-in swap. |
| **Python for backend** | Best ecosystem for AI/ML (MediaPipe, TensorFlow) + easy serial I/O |
| **WebSockets over REST for live data** | 500ms polling via REST would be noisy; WS is persistent and low-latency |
| **LSTM for prediction** | Time-series data with temporal dependencies is best handled by LSTM |
| **Zustand over Redux** | Simpler boilerplate, sufficient for this app's state complexity |
| **Recharts over D3** | React-native, simpler API, sufficient for the chart types needed |
| **100% local, no cloud** | Privacy-first is a key differentiator; no data ever leaves the device |
| **Rule engine + RL** | Rules handle known states deterministically; RL handles personalization over time |

